Tags in HTML
------------
1. pair tags/open-close tags : <p></p>
2. self closing tags(void tags) <br>

<h1>to<h6> heading
<p> paragraph
<a> anchor tag
<img> image
<br> line break
<hr> horizontal line
<strong> bold text
<em> italic text
<ol> order list
<ul> unorder list
<table> table
<form> form

Non-semantic elements:- div, span
semantic elements:- <header>, <nav>, <section>, <article>, <footer>  // Websites prefers semantic elements more...
